# Imagineer / Glil Portfolio — Development Rules

## Task workflow

1. Break every prompt into tasks in `/todo.md` (○ ◐ ● ✕).
2. Work sequentially; mark progress immediately; clear `todo.md` when done.

## Stack

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + yarn
- Supabase (Auth, Database, Storage) — project `puibdsyokgjdvkkousil`
- Zod validation; React Query for admin client state
- Services in `src/services/<table>/`; features in `src/features/<name>/`
- Import Supabase only from `@/lib/supabase/client` or `server`
- Never put `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` in `src/`
- Max ~100 lines per TS/TSX file; no `any`; named exports

## Migrations

- All schema changes via `supabase/migrations/`
- RLS required on every table
- Regenerate types after push into `src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts`

## UI

- Shared UI in `src/components/ui/` (ask before new shared components)
- Public portfolio under `src/features/portfolio`
- Admin under `src/features/admin` + `src/app/admin`
